  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "MenuItemComponent is a core Angular UI component responsible for rendering a single, interactive item within a hierarchical menu structure. It manages the visibility state of sub-menus using hover events and implements a debounced closing mechanism. Its primary function is to emit an onItemClick event when a final, non-parent item is selected, allowing parent components to handle the resulting action."
